export function filterDataProps(t){return filterProps(t,isDataAttribute)}export function filterAriaProps(t){return filterProps(t,isAriaAttribute)}export function filterProps(t,r){const i=Object.entries(t).filter(r),e={};for(const[t,r]of i)e[t]=r;return e}export function isDataAttribute(t){const[r,i]=t;return 0===r.indexOf("data-")&&"string"==typeof i}export function isAriaAttribute(t){return 0===t[0].indexOf("aria-")}